{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"subscript","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"orKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key to use to get a value","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"key"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In fact if it seems some rules are missing, or weight are not managed, if the font family only is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user has an higher probability to use the expected font. Because if a mashup of family name and weight is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it can produce a PostScript identifier not available, so not usable, so implying a fallback to default system font like ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"San Francisco","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because PostScript identifiers in most of cases do not have whitespaces, remove them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Given a dictionary with one value","    let myDict: PostScriptFontNamesMap = [PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold): \"Aria-BoldMT\"]","","    \/\/ The given value is returned if the key exists","    let keyExists = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Arial-BoldMT","","    \/\/ But if the key does not exist, the only the key is returned","    let keyDoesNotExist = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Luciole\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Luciole"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(orKey:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:SD15OUDSFoundationsAA25PostScriptFontNamesMapKeyVRszSSRs_rlE02orG0SSAC_tcip","symbolKind":"subscript","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PostScriptFontNamesMapKey"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Foundations"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"orKey"},{"kind":"text","text":" _: "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Key"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Subscript","title":"subscript(orKey:)","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"If there is no value for the given ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"text":", returns the description of this key,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"i.e.font family name without the font weight in the end and without whitespaces.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/swift\/dictionary\/subscript(orkey:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OU